      "term": "Twiddle factor",
      "definition": "Complex root of unity that multiplies intermediate results between stages of a divide-and-conquer transform.",
      "formula": "W_{N}^{k}=e^{-j2\\pi k/N}",
      "unit": 3,
      "unitTitle": "Fast Fourier Transform",
      "sources": [
