      "id": "inverse-fft",
      "term": "Inverse FFT",
      "definition": "Fast evaluation of x_n = (1/N)ΣX_k e^(i2πkn/N), obtained from a forward algorithm by flipping the exponent sign and scaling by 1/N.",
      "formula": "x[n]=\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{k=0}^{N-1}X[k]\\,e^{j2\\pi kn/N}",
